  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h1 id=\"atak---data-sync\"><a href=\"#atak---data-sync\">ATAK - Data Sync</a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"atak-connected-to-takserver---subscribe-to-recon-feed\"><a href=\"#atak-connected-to-takserver---subscribe-to-recon-feed\">ATAK connected to takserver - Subscribe to RECON feed</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Read Feeds using Data Sync",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Data Sync lets you read (and share) map markers and more easily.</li>\n<li>Feeds are like map layers: subscribe and then tick to see or disable them.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "See What Feeds are Available",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select Data Sync (arrows icon) on toolbar</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5e32c5f54248b72d.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Subscribe to RECON feed",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select your takserver (if many)</li>\n<li>Select the RECON feed</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6b7e8960e01ec760.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Download & Sync",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select Download &#x26; Sync to have it</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4ca381418b7341b0.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Feed - Connected",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Check that RECON feed mark is green</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/761f96f700f37fa1.webp",
              "width": 2256,
              "height": 1009
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "There's more",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Creating, sharing and subscribing Feeds for eg. planning then executing a mission is easy.</li>\n<li>We offer an out of the box setup for efficient data sharing for a military unit.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "Done",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You can close this guide.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>After successful connection to RECON feed, continue to <a href=\"/doc/82c77545-7b47-4c8a-bf4b-2701a1bb3943\">Blue force tracking</a></p>"
    }
  ]
